      "text": [
        "1685 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «اَلْمَعْرُوفُ شَيْءٌ سِوَى اَلزَّكَاةِ فَتَقَرَّبُوا إِلَى اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ بِالْبِرِّ وَ صِلَةِ اَلرَّحِمِ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1685 - Imam (as) said: “Kindness is something distinct from almsgiving; therefore, draw closer to Allah (swt), the Glorious and Exalted, through acts of goodness and maintaining family ties.\""
        ]
      }
